      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSIC BEESMACK (3) was good when third from the back row in a higher-graded race last week. Won two of his previous three tries at this circuit and distance, coming from one spot wider to score by 11.5m in this grade two back. That looks a strong pointer for this. GET UP BETTY (2) led to win last month at Young and has finished top-four in each outing since, beaten just over a metre from the back row here last week. She has the pace to be prominent from the low draw. MAGIC MATTEO (6) draws wider but is open to further improvement at the third run back from a spell after saluting last time out at Wagga. TERRYRAMA (7) broke last time but had looked close to a win when runner-up in two of his previous three outings here so is worth some thought.",
